msgid "Bring your own API key"
msgstr "Bawa kunci API Anda sendiri"

#: templates/index.html:134
msgid ""
"Add a Google Generative AI key in your profile. Or use the shared pool "
"with your credits. Either way, generations route through your account."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan kunci Google Generative AI di profil Anda. Atau gunakan kolam "
"bersama dengan kredit Anda. Bagaimanapun, pembuatan dirutekan melalui "
"akun Anda."

#: templates/index.html:135
msgid "Add key →"
msgstr "Tambah kunci →"

#: templates/index.html:143
msgid "Share with the community"
msgstr "Bagikan dengan komunitas"

#: templates/index.html:144
msgid ""
"When a prompt is ready, share it. Browse what others have shipped. Fork "
"anything you like into your own library."
